xnu 0172: enable the two GMU clocks still missing (gpupower=1)

The gmu node's bulk list also has gcc_ddrss_gpu_axi_clk (0x81154) and
gpu_cc_gx_gmu_clk (0x90bc); the vendor enables all seven together and
clk_bulk_prepare_enable fails if one is off. Enable them with the rest
before the GPUCC AHB check.
